    "README.md": "Kestrel Grid Operations - August meter ingest archive.\n\nThe concentrator writes one drop file per meter reading. Drops land in\nintake/ while the batch is open and are moved to spool/ once the batch\nis closed, so the two folders together are the archive. Every drop file\nopens with the meter column line and holds a single reading below it.\nmanifests/ keeps the batch scrolls the concentrator sends for each\nsubstation; the scrolls carry no meter readings.\n",
